{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Mixed Flower Seeds are seeds capable of producing a specific set of crops (listed below). The specific crop that grows from one Mixed Flower Seed is randomly chosen when it is planted. The choice is normally limited to crops of the current season, even indoors in the ",["l","温室","Greenhouse"]," and in the ",["l","花盆","Garden Pot"],". Mixed Flower Seeds cannot be planted outside in winter. If they are planted indoors in winter, then the type of crop is randomly chosen from crops of all seasons. Mixed Flower Seeds planted on ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"]," will always produce summer crops."]]]],["Sources",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Harvesting ",["l","杂草","Weeds"]," in the ",["l","夏季","Summer"]," with a ",["l","镰刀","Scythe"],", ",["l","斧头","Axe"],", ",["l","十字镐","Pickaxe"],", ",["l","锄头","Hoe"],", ",["l","武器#Sword","Sword"],", or ",["l","打造#Bombs","bomb"],", if no ",["l","纤维","Fiber"]," or ",["l","混合种子","Mixed Seeds"]," drop (9% chance if ",["l","浣熊日记","Raccoon Journal"]," has been read, otherwise 5%)"]],[1,["Sold by ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s (8 Calico Eggs for 5), ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],"'s (2 Calico Eggs each), and ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],"'s (2 Calico Eggs each) ",["l","沙漠节#Villager Shops","shops"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]]],[1,["4-5 may occasionally be found in ",["l","补给箱","Supply Crate"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图#Beach","Beach Farm"]]],[1,["10 from ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es (≈5.9% chance)"]],[1,["15 from the ",["l","镇长的庄园#Prize Machine","prize machine"]," in the ",["l","镇长的庄园","Mayor's Manor"]," (50% chance to be the 3rd prize)"]]]]]],["List of Seeds",2,[["p",["Mixed Flower Seeds will turn into the following seeds upon planting."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Season"]},{"h":1,"v":["Seeds"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Spring"]},[["i","(O)427","Tulip Bulb"]," • ",["i","(O)429","Jazz Seeds"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Summer"]},[["i","(O)431","Sunflower Seeds"]," • ",["i","(O)455","Spangle Seeds"]," • ",["i","(O)453","Poppy Seeds"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Fall"]},[["i","(O)431","